名称、地址和电话号码。

61
00:05:39,440 --> 00:05:44,520
This is provided in case you have questions about the SDS or the material itself.
这是为了方便你对安全技术说明书或物质本身有疑问时联系。

62
00:05:44,520 --> 00:05:52,040
An emergency telephone number may also be listed for quick access to additional information.
还可能列出一个应急电话号码，以便快速获取更多信息。

63
00:05:52,040 --> 00:05:56,120
Section 2 describes the hazards that are associated with the chemical, including the
第 2 部分描述与该化学品相关的危害，包括

64
00:05:56,120 --> 00:06:02,480
information that's provided on the chemical's label, such as the signal word, hazard statements
化学品标签上提供的信息，比如信号词、危险说明

65
00:06:02,480 --> 00:06:04,760
