Even more protection may be necessary for some hazardous chemicals.
对于某些危险化学品，可能还需要更多的防护。

104
00:09:04,600 --> 00:09:09,540
Section 6 tells you what to do in case of spills, leaks and other accidental releases
第 6 部分告诉你在发生危险物质溅洒、泄漏和其他意外释放时

105
00:09:09,540 --> 00:09:12,600
of hazardous materials.
该怎么做。

106
00:09:12,600 --> 00:09:18,040
Included in this section are general procedures for containing a spill or other accidental
这一部分包括一般程序，用于控制溅洒或其他意外

107
